4
00:00:13,380 --> 00:00:16,380
Since Mu Yi has become a state, he can only take one step at a time.

5
00:00:16,380 --> 00:00:21,600
Xue Yu probably grew up with a fourth-level elixir, and had a very sculpted mouth, so he could only be trained by a second-level elixir.

6
00:00:21,600 --> 00:00:28,141
Gained experience in dealing with Yan Jiaxiong

7
00:00:28,141 --> 00:00:37,060
